      "preparation_patch": null,
      "preparation_patch_sha256": null,
      "prompt": "Add a session-wide default timeout to Requests. Session(timeout=None) must expose a mutable Session.timeout attribute, defaulting to the current unlimited behavior. A request that omits timeout inherits the current session value; an explicit timeout=None disables that default for the request. Other explicit timeout values override the default without mutating it. Apply this consistently to Session.request, all Session HTTP-method helpers, and direct Session.send of a PreparedRequest. Every hop in a redirect chain must receive the effective timeout selected for the initial request. Preserve timeout across pickling. Keep existing module-level request helpers and ordinary timeout/adapter behavior compatible. Add regression tests.",
      "reference_patch": ".cache/agent-grep-2026-10-15/controls-v2/requests_default_timeout/reference.patch",
