      "preparation_patch_sha256": null,
      "prompt": "Add an opt-in continue_on_error keyword-only boolean to BackgroundTasks, defaulting to False. Reject non-booleans with ValueError at construction. The default must retain stop-on-first-error behavior. With continue_on_error=True, execute every registered task sequentially in registration order despite ordinary Exception failures, then re-raise the first exception object with its original callback traceback retained. Preserve synchronous threadpool dispatch, async callbacks, initial task sequences, add_task positional/keyword arguments, and response integration. BaseException failures, including cancellation, must propagate immediately and stop later tasks, even if an earlier ordinary exception was recorded. Successful and empty task lists still return None. Cover both asyncio and Trio and add regression tests.",
