      "preparation_patch_sha256": null,
      "prompt": "Fix HTTPX Headers.get_list(key, split_commas=True) so commas inside double-quoted strings do not split a header value, including quoted parameter values such as text/plain; title=\"a,b\". Inside double quotes a backslash escapes the following character, so escaped quotes do not end the quoted section and an escaped backslash does not escape the quote after it. Outside double quotes a backslash has no escaping role; single quotes are ordinary characters. Preserve original quote and backslash spelling and whitespace inside each member while stripping surrounding member whitespace. Preserve empty members, including leading/trailing commas and an empty header. An unmatched opening double quote keeps the rest of that physical header value as one member; reset parser state between repeated header occurrences. Preserve repeated header order, case-insensitive lookup, the default split_commas=False behavior and raw stored headers without mutation. Add regression tests.",
      "reference_patch": ".cache/agent-grep-2026-10-15/controls-v2/httpx_quoted_headers/reference.patch",
